+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+This project (gin, a Go HTTP framework) has no recorded decision on an async runtime. Go's standard concurrency model (goroutines and the standard library `net/http` server) is used throughout, and no project documentation, configuration, or changelog entry designates or discusses a separate async runtime choice.
